{"id":"6e637b613a7ac0c5","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-S-ar.md","title":"Arithmetic Symbol Set","display":"df-S-ar — Arithmetic Symbol Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-S-ar","aliases":["57-df-S-ar","57-df-arithmetic-symbol"],"display":"df-S-ar — Arithmetic Symbol Set","depends_on":["[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-omega]]","[[57-df-term]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-S-ar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-S-ar</span><span>57-df-arithmetic-symbol</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-S-ar — Arithmetic Symbol Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-S-ar-—-Arithmetic-Symbol-Set-$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$\">df-S-ar — Arithmetic Symbol Set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\mathrm S,+,\\times,&lt;\">\\(0,\\mathrm S,+,\\times,&lt;\\)</span> 是彼此不同、与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym}\\)</span> 不交的形式符号；变量和逻辑字母见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm S\">\\(\\mathrm S\\)</span> 是通常排印为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的后继符号，不是整个字母表变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 保留原非逻辑符号集接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 是其总字母表视图。对下列两种下标给出相同符号分区。项、公式、句子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a>；结构见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a> 的自然数集合；自然数加法和乘法是背景集合论中的通常递归运算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 是下式明确构造的标准结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\{S_{\\mathrm{ar}},\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\{S_{\\mathrm{ar}},\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\}\\)</span>；涉及符号分区的各式分别对这两种下标成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nS_{\\mathrm{ar}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,\\mathrm S,+,\\times\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}\\cup S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_0(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{0\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_1(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm S\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_2(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{+,\\times\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\ge3),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm S,+,\\times\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ar}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Struct}(\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}),\\qquad\nS_{\\mathrm{ar}}^&lt;\\coloneqq S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{&lt;\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nS_{\\mathrm{ar}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,\\mathrm S,+,\\times\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}\\cup S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_0(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{0\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_1(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm S\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_2(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{+,\\times\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\ge3),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm S,+,\\times\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ar}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Struct}(\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}),\\qquad\nS_{\\mathrm{ar}}^&lt;\\coloneqq S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{&lt;\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI_{\\mathbb N}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;I_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,n+1\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nI_{\\mathbb N}(+)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,m+n\\rangle:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},&amp;\nI_{\\mathbb N}(\\times)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,mn\\rangle:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak N&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbb N,I_{\\mathbb N}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI_{\\mathbb N}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;I_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,n+1\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nI_{\\mathbb N}(+)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,m+n\\rangle:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},&amp;\nI_{\\mathbb N}(\\times)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,mn\\rangle:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak N&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbb N,I_{\\mathbb N}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>未把 S_ar 的四元符号集改成第 88 本的签名元组。补全视图用于连接本册的总字母表语法。数码中的 0、S 是形式符号；标准结构给出它们的解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-S-ar-—-Arithmetic-Symbol-Set-$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$","text":"df-S-ar — Arithmetic Symbol Set $S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$0,\\mathrm S,+,\\times,<$ 是彼此不同、与 $\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym}$ 不交的形式符号；变量和逻辑字母见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\mathrm S$ 是通常排印为 $S$ 的后继符号，不是整个字母表变量。","e