ex":"\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\{S_{\\mathrm{ar}},\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nS_{\\mathrm{ar}}&\\coloneqq\\{0,\\mathrm S,+,\\times\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}\\cup S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_\\tau&\\coloneqq\\{0\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_0(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{0\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_1(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm S\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_2(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{+,\\times\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\ge3),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm S,+,\\times\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ar}})&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Struct}(\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}),\\qquad\nS_{\\mathrm{ar}}^<\\coloneqq S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{<\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nI_{\\mathbb N}(0)&\\coloneqq0,&I_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm S)&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,n+1\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nI_{\\mathbb N}(+)&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,m+n\\rangle:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},&\nI_{\\mathbb N}(\\times)&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,mn\\rangle:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak N&\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbb N,I_{\\mathbb N}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2946,"backlinks":[{"id":"5a8141676f191f64","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 见 [[57-df-S-ar]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}$、$\\mathrm{QFree}$、$\\mathrm{Var}$ 见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-quantifier-free]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。本文件的 $\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0$ 是**原始语法公式集合**，保留量词自由的初层，不是自然数集合的类。$n,k\\in\\mathbb N$，变量块长度允许零；$\\exists\\vec x\\varphi$ 和 $\\forall\\vec x\\varphi$ 按所列顺序逐个构造量词，空块返回原公式。"},{"id":"afc42c965ba86683","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 及其后继符号 $\\mathrm S$ 见 [[57-df-S-ar]]；$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[57-df-omega]]，项构造子见 [[57-df-term]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\underline{\\phantom n}$ 是以下自然数递归确定的函数，不是预先给定的数码族。"},{"id":"658bea3e76b250ff","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为扩展 $S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 的有效可数语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)$。$\\vdash$ 为 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶关系，$\\mathfrak N$ 为 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构。$\\Sigma_1^0$ 在本文件专指 [[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]] 的语法公式集合。固定变量 $x$；使用 $\\mathrm{Bew}_T$ 时，必须同时给出一个 $B_T\\in\\mathcal B(T,g,x)$，该候选族由下式定义。不同合法选择不被视为字面相同的公式。"},{"id":"cb58718fcb0cc76b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4744f89052b0cbdb","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 扩展 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的算术语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k$。固定互异变量 $\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)$ 和证明系统 $\\mathcal P$；$\\vdash$ 指 $\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}$。$\\varphi[\\underline{\\vec n}/\\vec x]$ 为同时把各 $x_i$ 的自由出现替换为闭数码 $\\underline{n_i}$，数码见 [[57-df-numeral]]。"},{"id":"cd1d3a421d8f589e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ar}} = \\{0, S, +, \\times\\}$ (算术签名, see [[57-df-S-ar]])"},{"id":"2d8f5002c4256603","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"